{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011h4FPQ4eTa7yGM4tAqQxdw","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me analyze the research context carefully to define three tiers for the Dream simulation.\n\nKey information:\n- Project: importance_margin_vla_compress\n- Venue: CoRL 2026\n- Core method: IMM (Importance Margin Maximization) with two-stage training for VLA token compression robustness\n- Key results so far (from mvp_imm_v8b_twostage, the successful experiment):\n  - G1 margin ratio: 93.23x\n  - G2 preservation diff: +56pp\n  - G3 deploy ratio: 0.8679 (compression actually improves performance by ~13%)\n  - G4 LED median: 0.1354\n  - ACIS prune action loss: 0.003538 vs baseline 0.004063\n\nKey concerns from the focus:\n1. G3<1.0 denoising claim - can it withstand reviewer scrutiny?\n2. Only SmolVLA + aloha_sim_insertion - one data point\n3. Two-stage training generality across models/benchmarks\n4. Formal bound practical value\n\nThe main challenge is that I only have one successful experiment validating the approach on a single model and task, with many planned experiments still pending, and v8c annealing work in progress.\n\nNow I'm thinking through what success looks like at different levels: best case would be the two-stage method generalizing across OpenVLA and LIBERO with a consistent G3<1.0 bound and measurable success rate improvements, median case would show it working on SmolVLA across different benchmarks but struggling with larger models, and worst case would reveal the approach is too specific to this one setting with a bound too loose to be meaningful.\n\nI'm defining the specific metrics I need to track: the G3 deploy ratio as my primary compression indicator, success rate deltas between compressed and baseline versions, how G3 holds up across different models and benchmarks, how tight my theoretical bound is in practice, and what preservation rate I'm achieving at my target epsilon threshold.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":12202,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":12202},"output_tokens":10,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"54b37d70-0aa2-42ed-b4e7-ae3663516250","uuid":"ea3cc7fe-3102-4bd2-8c06-adbe8b7cee6a"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011h4FPQ4eTa7yGM4tAqQxdw","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"```yaml\ntiers:\n  best:\n    meaning: \"Two-stage IMM 在跨模型/跨 benchmark 上全面复现，G3<1.0 denoising 有机理支撑，formal bound 实证 tight\"\n    key_assumptions:\n      - Two-stage training 在 OpenVLA+LIBERO 上同样产生 G3<1.0\n      - 被 pruned token 的 attention weight 显著低于保留 token（p<0.01），denoising 解释成立\n      - Formal bound 在 eps=0.01~0.05 范围内 tightness ratio < 3x（empirical violation / theoretical prediction）\n      - Success rate 与 action loss 方向一致——压缩后 success rate ≥ baseline\n      - Pruning ratio sweep 显示 0.4~0.6 区间存在稳定的 sweet spot\n    number_ranges:\n      G3_deploy_ratio_smolvla: [0.82, 0.92]\n      G3_deploy_ratio_openvla: [0.85, 0.98]\n      G3_deploy_ratio_libero_avg: [0.85, 0.95]\n      success_rate_delta_pp: [0, +8]  # compressed - baseline, percentage points\n      bound_tightness_ratio_eps001: [1.0, 3.0]\n      eps001_preservation_rate: [0.90, 0.95]\n      cross_model_margin_ratio: [40, 93]\n      pruned_token_attn_weight_ratio: [0.1, 0.4]  # pruned/retained, lower = stronger denoising signal\n    narrative_direction: \"原始 framing 完全成立——IMM 提供首个 certified robustness + lossless compression for VLA，三条 claim 均有跨模型跨 benchmark 支撑。Denoising claim 从 empirical observation 升级为 mechanistic finding。Paper 可以 lead with 'provably robust AND performance-enhancing compression'。CoRL 投稿无需降低任何 claim 强度。\"\n\n  median:\n    meaning: \"Two-stage 在 SmolVLA 跨 benchmark 有效但大模型效果减弱，G3<1.0 部分成立但非普适，bound 方向正确但 loose\"\n    key_assumptions:\n      - Two-stage 在 SmolVLA+LIBERO 产生 G3≈0.9~1.05（部分 task 低于 1，部分略高于 1）\n      - OpenVLA 上 G3 在 1.0~1.15 之间——压缩不再无损但 degradation 可控\n      - Formal bound tightness ratio 5~10x——方向正确但审稿人可能认为太 loose\n      - Success rate 方向一致但差异不显著（p>0.05）\n      - Denoising 解释有部分证据但不够 conclusive（attention 差异存在但 effect size 小）\n    number_ranges:\n      G3_deploy_ratio_smolvla: [0.82, 0.92]\n      G3_deploy_ratio_openvla: [1.0, 1.15]\n      G3_deploy_ratio_libero_avg: [0.90, 1.05]\n      success_rate_delta_pp: [-3, +4]\n      bound_tightness_ratio_eps001: [5.0, 10.0]\n      eps001_preservation_rate: [0.88, 0.93]\n      cross_model_margin_ratio: [15, 50]\n      pruned_token_attn_weight_ratio: [0.3, 0.6]\n    narrative_direction: \"Claim 2 降级为 'near-lossless compression with robustness guarantee'——不再强调 performance gain，改为强调 robustness-compression tradeoff 的 Pareto improvement。Claim 3 从独立 claim 降级为 'empirical observation consistent with denoising hypothesis'，放入 analysis section 而非 core contribution。Claim 1 certified bound 改为强调 'principled design criterion' 而非 'tight guarantee'——bound 的价值在于指导训练目标设计而非运行时认证。Story 从 'provably robust + lossless' 调整为 'first robustness-aware compression framework with theoretical grounding'。仍可投 CoRL 但需要补充 computational overhead analysis 证明 practical value。\"\n\n  worst:\n    meaning: \"G3<1.0 仅限 aloha_sim_insertion，跨场景/跨模型均 G3>1.1，two-stage 的优势主要是避免 backbone 损坏而非真正 denoising\"\n    key_assumptions:\n      - LIBERO 上 G3 在 1.1~1.3——压缩有明显 degradation\n      - OpenVLA 上 two-stage 训练不收敛或 G3>1.2\n      - Success rate 下降 5~15pp，暴露 action loss 与 success rate 的非线性关系\n      - Formal bound tightness ratio >15x，审稿人判定 bound vacuous\n      - G3<1.0 在 aloha_sim_insertion 上被发现与该 task 的 token redundancy 特殊性相关（非通用现象）\n      - Denoising 解释缺乏机理证据——pruned token 的 attention weight 与 retained 无显著差异\n    number_ranges:\n      G3_deploy_ratio_smolvla: [0.82, 0.92]  # 原始 task 仍 hold\n      G3_deploy_ratio_openvla: [1.15, 1.35]\n      G3_deploy_ratio_libero_avg: [1.10, 1.30]\n      success_rate_delta_pp: [-15, -5]\n      bound_tightness_ratio_eps001: [15.0, 50.0]\n      eps001_preservation_rate: [0.85, 0.92]\n      cross_model_margin_ratio: [5, 20]\n      pruned_token_attn_weight_ratio: [0.5, 0.9]\n    narrative_direction: \"核心 reframe：放弃 'lossless compression' 和 'denoising' 叙事，转向 'robustness-efficiency Pareto frontier' 视角。新 story：现有压缩方法在 adversarial 下 catastrophically fail（preservation 33%），IMM 将其提升至 85-92%，代价是 G3=1.1~1.3 的可控 degradation。这是一个 explicit tradeoff knob——通过调 margin loss weight 在 robustness-accuracy Pareto 上滑动。Claim 1 保留但弱化为 'design principle'（bound 指导训练目标选择，不做 runtime certification）。Claim 2 改为 'controlled degradation with certified robustness benefit'。Claim 3 删除，替换为 'task-adaptive compression ratio selection' 实验。仍投 CoRL——robustness 在 deployment 场景的重要性本身足够撑 contribution，不依赖 lossless 才 novel。需要加一个 Pareto 图作为 headline figure。\"\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":12202,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":12202},"output_tokens":10,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"54b37d70-0aa2-42ed-b4e7-ae3663516250","uuid":"3ea631ef-01a8-4f67-aa5b-97cf2e33567b"}
